  { lang: 'uz', href: canonical },
  { lang: 'ru', href: 'https://starsjoy.uz/ru/blog/telegram-stars-premium-statistika-2026' },
  { lang: 'en', href: 'https://starsjoy.uz/en/blog/telegram-stars-premium-statistics-2026' },
]}>
  <Navbar />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article",headline:"Telegram Stars va Premium statistikasi 2026: asosiy raqamlar",description,datePublished:publishDate,dateModified:publishDate,inLanguage:"uz-UZ",articleSection:"Stars",author:{"@type":"Organization",name:"StarsJoy",url:"https://starsjoy.uz"},publisher:{"@type":"Organization",name:"StarsJoy",logo:{"@type":"ImageObject",url:"https://starsjoy.uz/logo.png"}},mainEntityOfPage:canonical,image:"https://starsjoy.uz/og-image.png"})} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList",itemListElement:[{"@type":"ListItem",position:1,name:"Bosh sahifa",item:"https://starsjoy.uz"},{"@type":"ListItem",position:2,name:"Blog",item:"https://starsjoy.uz/blog"},{"@type":"ListItem",position:3,name:"Stars va Premium statistikasi 2026",item:canonical}]})} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage",mainEntity:faqs.map(([name,text])=>({"@type":"Question",name,acceptedAnswer:{"@type":"Answer",text}}))})} />

  <article class="blog-post">
    <header class="post-hero"><div class="container"><nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Bosh sahifa</a><span>/</span><a href="/blog">Blog</a><span>/</span><span>Stars va Premium statistikasi 2026</span></nav><div class="post-tag">Stars</div><h1 class="post-title">Telegram Stars va Premium statistikasi 2026: asosiy raqamlar</h1><div class="post-meta"><span>{publishDate}</span><span>StarsJoy Blog</span></div></div></header>
    <div class="post-body"><div class="container"><div class="post-content">
      <section><p class="post-lead"><strong>Qisqa javob:</strong> Telegram 2026-yilda <strong>1 milliarddan ortiq</strong> oylik faol foydalanuvchiga ega, ulardan <strong>15 million+</strong> Premium obunachi (taxminan 1,5%). 2024-yilda kompaniya birinchi marta foyda ko'rdi ($547 mln), 2025-yil birinchi yarim yilligida daromad $870 mln'ga yetdi (+65%), lekin TON tokeni qadrsizlanishi sabab shu davrda $220 mln+ zarar ham qayd etildi. Quyida — barcha raqamlar sana va manba bilan.</p></section>

      <section><h2>Telegram nechta foydalanuvchiga ega?</h2><p>Telegram asoschisi Pavel Durov 2025-yil 20-mart kuni <a href="https://x.com/durov/status/1902454590747902091" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">X (Twitter) orqali</a> "significantly over 1 billion monthly active users" — ya'ni 1 milliarddan sezilarli darajada ko'p oylik faol foydalanuvchini rasman e'lon qildi. Bu WeChat'dan tashqari dunyodagi ikkinchi eng ommaviy messenjer ekanini bildiradi.</p><p>Durovning o'sha e'lonida keltirilgan ishtirok ko'rsatkichlari: o'rtacha foydalanuvchi ilovani <strong>kuniga 21 marta</strong> ochadi va unda <strong>kuniga 41 daqiqa</strong> vaqt o'tkazadi. Uchinchi tomon tahliliy platformalar kundalik faol foydalanuvchini taxminan <strong>500 million</strong> deb baholaydi — bu MAU'ning yarmiga teng va sanoat o'rtachasidan yuqori ko'rsatkich (taxminan, rasmiy tasdiqlanmagan).</p></section>

      <section><h2>Telegram Premium necha million obunachi to'plagan?</h2><div class="post-table-wrap"><table class="post-table"><thead><tr><th>Sana</th><th>Premium obunachilar</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>2023-dekabr</td><td>4 million</td></tr><tr><td>2024-sentabr</td><td>10 million</td></tr><tr><td>2024-dekabr</td><td>12 million</td></tr><tr><td>2025-may</td><td>15 million+</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Durov 2025-yil may oyida <a href="https://x.com/durov/status/1927460225461662111" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">X orqali</a> "Telegram Premium now has over 15 million paid subscribers" deb e'lon qildi va bu son bir yil ichida ikki barobar oshganini ta'kidladi. 15 million — 1 milliard MAU'ning taxminan <strong>1,5%i</strong>, ya'ni Premium hali ham kichik ulush, lekin 18 oyda deyarli 4 barobar o'sgan segment.</p><p>Premium nimalarni o'z ichiga olishi va tariflar solishtiruvi haqida to'liq ma'lumot: <a href="/blog/telegram-premium-paketlar-taqqoslash">Premium paketlarini taqqoslash</a> va <a href="/blog/telegram-premium-funksiyalari">barcha Premium funksiyalari</a>.</p></section>

      <section><h2>Telegram qancha daromad topmoqda?</h2><div class="post-table-wrap"><table class="post-table"><thead><tr><th>Davr</th><th>Ko'rsatkich</th><th>Qiymat</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>2024 (yil davomida)</td><td>Umumiy daromad</td><td>$1 mlrd+</td></tr><tr><td>2024 (yil davomida)</td><td>Sof foyda</td><td>$547 mln (birinchi foydali yil)</td></tr><tr><td>2025 H1</td><td>Daromad</td><td>$870 mln (+65% YoY)</td></tr><tr><td>2025 H1</td><td>Sof natija</td><td>$220 mln+ zarar (TON qadrsizlanishi tufayli)</td></tr><tr><td>2025 (maqsad)</td><td>Yillik daromad</td><td>$2 mlrd (FT xabariga ko'ra)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Durov 2024-yil dekabr oyida <a href="https://techcrunch.com/2024/12/23/pavel-durov-says-telegram-is-now-profitable" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">rasman e'lon qildi</a>: yillik daromad $1 milliarddan oshdi, sof foyda esa $547 million'ni tashkil etdi — bu kompaniya tarixidagi birinchi foydali yil. Yil oxirida kassada $500 million'dan ortiq mablag' qolgan, so'nggi to'rt yilda chiqarilgan ~$2 milliardlik qarz obligatsiyasining katta qismi 2024-yil kuzida qaytarilgan.</p><p>2025-yil birinchi yarim yilligida rasm o'zgardi. Financial Times xabar qilishicha, daromad $525 million (H1 2024)dan $870 million'gacha (+65%) o'sdi va kompaniya yil uchun $2 milliardlik maqsad qo'ygan. Ammo shu davrda TON tokeni qiymati 69%ga tushib ketgani (CoinGecko ma'lumoti) sabab, Telegram $450 million'dan ortiq TON sotishga majbur bo'ldi va natijada H1 2024'dagi $334 million foyda o'rniga H1 2025'da <strong>$220 million'dan ortiq sof zarar</strong> qayd etdi. Bu Telegram daromadining katta qismi hali ham kripto-aktivlar narxiga bog'liqligini ko'rsatadi.</p></section>

      <section><h2>Stars narxi xalqaro miqyosda qancha turadi?</h2><p>Telegram Stars'ni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri App Store yoki Google Play orqali sotib olsa, narx AQSh dollarida hisoblanadi va xalqaro to'lov kartasini talab qiladi:</p><div class="post-table-wrap"><table class="post-table"><thead><tr><th>Stars miqdori</th><th>App Store narxi (taxminan, 2026)</th><th>StarsJoy narxi (so'mda)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>100 Stars</td><td>$1.99</td><td>24 000 so'm</td></tr><tr><td>1 000 Stars</td><td>$14.99</td><td>240 000 so'm</td></tr><tr><td>10 000 Stars</td><td>$134.99</td><td>2 400 000 so'm</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>App Store/Google Play narxi O'zbekistondagi ko'pchilik xaridor uchun amalda ishlamaydi — xalqaro Visa/Mastercard va tegishli hisob kerak. StarsJoy shu muammoni hal qiladi: Uzcard yoki Humo bilan to'g'ridan-to'g'ri so'mda, barcha miqdorlar uchun bir xil <strong>240 so'm/star</strong> tarifida. To'liq narxlar jadvali: <a href="/blog/telegram-stars-narxi">Stars narxi</a> va <a href="/blog/telegram-stars-eng-arzon-provayderlar">eng arzon provayderlar reytingi</a>.</p></section>

      <section><h2>Kontent yaratuvchilar Stars'dan qancha pul topadi?</h2><p>Kanal yoki bot egasi Stars'ni pulga aylantirganda, sanoat tahlillariga ko'ra taxminan <strong>$0.013/Star</strong> tushadi — agar xaridor Stars'ni veb yoki desktop versiyasidan sotib olgan bo'lsa. Foydalanuvchi Stars'ni mobil ilova (iOS yoki Android) ichida xarid qilsa, Apple yoki Google 30% komissiya oladi va yaratuvchiga tushadigan summa taxminan <strong>$0.009/Star</strong>'gacha kamayadi.</p><p>Shuning uchun ko'p kanal va bot egalari auditoriyasiga Stars'ni veb orqali xarid qilishni tavsiya qiladi — farq sezilarli. Ishlab topilgan Stars'ni qayta investitsiya qilish (masalan reklamaga) haqida: <a href="/blog/telegram-ads-stars-bilan">Telegram Ads'ni Stars bilan to'lash</a>. Stars ekotizimidagi barcha imkoniyatlar: <a href="/blog/telegram-stars-bilan-nima-qilish-mumkin">Stars bilan nima qilish mumkin</a>.</p></section>

      <section><h2>Telegram Gifts bozori qanchalik katta?</h2><p>Uchinchi tomon bozor tahliliga ko'ra, Telegram Gifts'ning ishga tushganidan buyongi umumiy savdo hajmi <strong>$354 million'dan oshgan</strong> (2026-mart holatiga). 2025-yil noyabr holatiga 2 million'dan ortiq foydalanuvchi jami 9 million'dan ortiq raqamli sovg'aga egalik qilgan. Oddiy sovg'ani noyob (NFT) versiyaga aylantirish TON tarmog'i to'lovi sifatida atigi <strong>25 Stars</strong> turadi.</p><p>Bu raqamlar bozorning umumiy hajmini ko'rsatadi; alohida sovg'alarning eng qimmat sotuvlari va rekord narxlari uchun <a href="/blog/eng-qimmat-telegram-sovgalari">eng qimmat Telegram sovg'alari TOP-10</a> maqolasini o'qing. NFT sovg'alar qanday ishlashi haqida: <a href="/blog/telegram-nft-gifts">Telegram NFT Gifts qo'llanmasi</a>.</p></section>

      <section><h2>Ko'p beriladigan savollar</h2><div class="post-faq">{faqs.map(([q,a])=><div class="post-faq-item"><h3>{q}</h3><p>{a}</p></div>)}</div></section>
      <section><h2>Xulosa</h2><p>Telegram statistikasi ikki narsani ko'rsatadi: foydalanuvchi sonida platforma ulkan va o'sishda davom etmoqda (1 mlrd+ MAU), lekin daromadi hali beqaror — asosiy sabab TON kriptovalyutasiga bog'liqlik. Stars va Premium ekotizimi esa mustahkam o'sishda: Premium 18 oyda deyarli 4 barobar, Gifts bozori $350 million'dan oshdi. O'zbekistondan bu ekotizimga xalqaro kartasiz kirish uchun eng amaliy yo'l — Uzcard yoki Humo bilan <a href="https://telegram.me/starsjoybot" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@starsjoybot</a> orqali so'mda xarid qilish.</p></section>
    </div></div></div>
  </article>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

